      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because `hyp` is a thin wrapper around the hypervisor ABI and `mmio_guard.map()` is a thin wrapper around the `MMIO_GUARD_MAP` HVC. OTOH, `MmioSharer` is slightly higher level and performs bookkeeping.\n\nSo the \"dependency\" can\u0027t really be inverted, in particular because the way we\u0027ve implemented polymorphism of the `hyp` back-end prevents it from holding any state, unfortunately...\n\nI\u0027m planning to address this `TODO` by instantiating the `MmioSharer` ASAP, instead.",
